                "Functional design (FSC level). Functional design of climate control: take the occupant's setpoint, actuate the compartment climate.",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  subgraph n_ClimateControlDesign[\"ClimateControlDesign\"]",
                "    n_ClimateControlDesign_ClimateSetpointHMI__563017f6[\"ClimateSetpointHMI<br/>(IHU_Climate)\"]",
